<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMSTERDAM OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the first round of</p>
<p>the Amsterdam Open men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seed):</p>
<p>Dennis van Scheppingen (Netherlands) beat 2-Albert Costa</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-3  6-4</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Tom Kempers (Netherlands) 5-7</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Fernando Vicente (Spain) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-3 7-6</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) beat 5-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 4-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat Marc Goellner (Germany) 7-5</p>
<p>1-6 6-4</p>
</text>
